@startuml agentic-product-service-boundary
title Agentic Product / Agentic Service Boundary , per ADR-ES-016 §9

skinparam monochrome true
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultTextAlignment center

class "Product" as P
class "Agentic Product" as AP
class "Service" as S
class "Agentic Service" as AS
class "Autonomous Service" as AutoS

P <|-- AP : specializes

AP --> S : may be delivered-through
S <|-- AS : specializes
S <|-- AutoS : specializes

note right
  Per ADR-ES-016 §9 + APROD-NEG-003:
  - An Agentic Service does NOT automatically make the Product Agentic
  - An Agentic Product may employ conventional or agentic services
end note

@enduml
